        ═══ ADIDAS SNIPPET REWRITE — 2026-08-29 ═══

        THE PROBLEM THIS SOLVES
        Live GSC, 28d to 2026-08-26: this page took 226 impressions at average
        position 6.5–7.3 and earned ONE click. 0.44% CTR. Desktop was 91
        impressions and ZERO clicks. Position 7 should return 2–3%.

            اديداس اورجينال ملابس   145 impr   1 clk   pos 6.5
            اديداس اورجينال          45 impr   0 clk   pos 8.6
            أديداس اورجينال المغرب   26 impr   0 clk   pos 9.5

        WHY THE OLD SNIPPET FAILED
        Every query is a variant of «اديداس اورجينال» — ORIGINAL Adidas — and the
        cluster includes «كم ثمنه» and «ثمن في المغرب». These are people checking
        whether Adidas is authentic and what it costs. The old description led with
        "second-hand", which answers neither, and named no price at all.

        WHY THE PRICE IS COMPUTED, NOT WRITTEN
        The cheapest Adidas piece is 199 MAD and it is SOLD OUT. The cheapest
        IN-STOCK piece is 230 MAD. A hardcoded "من 199 درهم" would be a false
        claim the day it shipped, and would go stale again on every restock.
        Same for categories: T-Shirts are entirely sold out, so a static list
        naming تيشرتات would advertise nothing. Both are read from live stock.

        If nothing is in stock, the price and category clauses drop out and the
        description falls back to trust copy — never "من 0 درهم".
      {%- endcomment -%}
